                                "example_id": "80a4d5a4-4692-46cb-8423-13b5659974db",
                                "sense_id": "c5cbf082-e56b-3809-9cb0-48203648fcc7",
                                "text": "I thank ye all. To you, my good lord mayor,\nAnd your good brethren, I am much beholding;\nI have received much honour by your presence,\nAnd ye shall find me thankful."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6406b7d6-9373-43e2-9d0b-31a106f259a3",
                                "sense_id": "c5cbf082-e56b-3809-9cb0-48203648fcc7",
                                "text": "I was much bound and beholding to the right reverend father."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f8408ca2-0cce-4232-a9df-f67a4378fdfc",
                                "sense_id": "c5cbf082-e56b-3809-9cb0-48203648fcc7",
                                "text": "So much hath Oxford been beholding to her nephews, or sister's children."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
